      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto (ll. 5\u201316 and right margin)",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>A court mission.</li>\n<li>We the undersigned went as emissaries of R. so and so the judge, may his Rock guard him, to so and so the daughter of m(aster) so and so, to appease</li>\n<li>her for her husband, m(aster) so and so, who has complained for an extended time and claims that she does not perform for him any</li>\n<li>of the tasks which wives are obligated to perform for their husbands. Moreover,</li>\n<li>he claims that she won&rsquo;t come into the same house with him. We tried to appease</li>\n<li>her, but were unsuccessful. She paid no attention</li>\n<li>to our words. Rather, she said, &ldquo;I do not</li>\n<li>want this husband of mine&rdquo;</li>\n<li>twice.</li>\n<li>She raised her voice demanding</li>\n<li>divorce</li>\n<li>and cursed this man, her husband, while he kept quiet. That which took place in our presence we have written and signed, in month such and such.</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
